<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110318" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμᾰκ-είᾱ</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>use of drugs,</i> esp. of
				<i>purgatives,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				1.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.36
			</span></i> (both pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				18.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.447
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἄνω φ.,</span> i. e.
			emetics, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				962a3
			</span></i>; of abortifacients, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.59
			</span></i>: generally, <i>the use of any kind of drugs, potions,</i>
			or <i>spells,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				933b
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				354a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ti.</u>
				89b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				535.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>poisoning</i> or <i>witchcraft,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				40
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.13.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				486.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ περὶ τὰς
				φαρμακείας,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ φαρμακίδες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				572a22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>remedy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδιὰς προσάγειν φαρμακείας χάριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1337b41
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
